  "name": "Scavenge Core (Su)",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "subType": "classFeat",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> —</p><p>The engineer learns to harden the core of his automaton and even imbue it with the magical energies of its constituent item. If the engineer's automaton is destroyed or dismantled, the engineer can harvest the core from the wreckage and place it into a new automaton. This new automaton gains all the magical enhancements of the old one, including enhancement bonuses and other properties. However, these enhancements override all magical enchantments provided by items used to construct the new automaton.</p>",
